Cell["\<\
The fiber of the displacement bundle over the centre is the circle of radius \
3, drawn by the second vertices of its pairs:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"0988f105-154c-4bb2-b4b7-f2c7233d244d"],

